      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EU VAT (VIES) & Official Registry KYB Enricher\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Connect Google Sheets and select your spreadsheet containing a `Companies` tab with a `vat_or_id` column (EU VAT, FR SIREN/SIRET, CH UID, NO Org.nr, FI Business ID, LEI, or company name) and an `Enriched_KYB` tab.\n2. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`.\n3. Run manually or attach a Schedule/Webhook trigger.\n\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/eu-company-kyb-enricher",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777001",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
